    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Teetering on the brink of existance lies the realm called the 'Edge'. Inhabited by only the hardiest of sorceresses. But there's only room for one <i>EdgeLord</i>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1871480/extras/40f4a487bbf2552126cf160b3b262f24.avif?t=1752747307\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>EdgeLords </strong>is a boss-rush strategy card game with card battler and deck-building elements, where two sorceresses fling spells at one another and summon minions to fight for dominance.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A totally unique take on the <strong>deck-building</strong> genre, with hundreds of cards to discover and play! As well as <strong>climax powers</strong> that unleash devastating abilities! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy a<strong> fully voiced and animated</strong> hentai animation for every opponent you defeat on your path to total supremacy as you harvest their 'essence' and seduce them into subservient thralls draped around the Edge Lord throne.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1871480/extras/0857c8d5ba5ded604b5c0e2dc787d43c.poster.avif?t=1752747307\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1871480/extras/0857c8d5ba5ded604b5c0e2dc787d43c.webm?t=1752747307\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1871480/extras/e4da1fea1b0995995cd2d9ebfe65f7de.avif?t=1752747307\" /></div>Death. Doom. Destruction. All will fall before her Dark Legion as she instigates the apocalypse and ends the world. <strong>Deathgrip</strong> is a gothic duluhan and her signature attack <strong><i>Reaper's Blade</i></strong>, which gains a Soul Gem card each time its played. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1871480/extras/4798dd0dda1420a0e7c67b3e1057de8f.avif?t=1752747307\" /></div>Under the hidden grove, deep within the tree of life lies the fountain where Melonie, the love fairy can be found. Her volumptious body is irresistable, giving her opponent's decks <strong><i>Temptation</i></strong> cards that are often too good to turn down. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1871480/extras/64a1cd2a6558f14a165468750fdb0a4b.avif?t=1752747307\" /></div>The most powerful warlock in the realm. <strong>Ashka</strong> is an arrogant, smug brat. Her spells are devastating, especially <strong><i>Concussive Blast</i></strong> - each time its played, its damage increases! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1871480/extras/6e1bf48d5865f627851ea4db08a32bd8.avif?t=1752747307\" /></div>Emerging from the flaming portal in the forbidden woods, <strong>Lilith</strong> is an assassin sent from the demon realm to claim the title of Lord. What she lacks in magic, she makes up for in action economy. Brace yourself for <strong><i>Hedonic Rush</i></strong>, which usually precedes another attack straight away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1871480/extras/611684121355e5e138e587aecdb4a248.poster.avif?t=1752747307\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1871480/extras/611684121355e5e138e587aecdb4a248.webm?t=1752747307\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> Features </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> 300+ playable cards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> 100+ summonable glyphs, allies and minions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> 4 playable characters, each with 4 erotic outfits that change their deck archtype</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> 12 unlockable fully animated, multi-stage, interactive hentai loops</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> 40+ Full Screen Still CGs with alts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Steam Achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Three game modes (Classic, Gauntlet and Puzzle) and a fourth (Pro-Create) in beta!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Multiple languages supported</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Custom full illustration by DankoDeadZone</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Full voice acting from Vexoria The Sun Eater (Deathgrip), GinnyFantasy (Melonie), Wubcake (Ashka) and GinaGalore (Lilith) </p></li></ul>",
