tore_item_assets/steam/apps/1871480/extras/611684121355e5e138e587aecdb4a248.webm?t=1752747307\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> Features </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> 300+ playable cards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> 100+ summonable glyphs, allies and minions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> 4 playable characters, each with 4 erotic outfits that change their deck archtype</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> 12 unlockable fully animated, multi-stage, interactive hentai loops</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> 40+ Full Screen Still CGs with alts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Steam Achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Three game modes (Classic, Gauntlet and Puzzle) and a fourth (Pro-Create) in beta!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Multiple languages supported</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Custom full illustration by DankoDeadZone</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Full voice acting from Vexoria The Sun Eater (Deathgrip), GinnyFantasy (Melonie), Wubcake (Ashka) and GinaGalore (Lilith) </p></li></ul>",
